From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 22:58:51 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 008/207] deepseek: supervise stalled owned engine operations

Address eduffd's issue #59 with an owned progress watchdog, default off, readiness withdrawal and fatal-error handoff. Host fixtures exercise blocked work and healthy idle or advancing work. This does not establish the cause of a GPU or distributed wedge.
